Guard section 5's arming destination (issue #36 / ADR-0003).

`bin/guard arm 5` copies 50-block-cron-entry-point.marker in here from
docker/nginx-guards-available/; docker-compose.yml bind-mounts this
directory read-only into the nginx container at /etc/wpcas/guards, where
docker/nginx/default.conf tests for that marker per request.

This placeholder exists only so the directory itself is tracked: git does
not track empty directories, and the bind mount needs it to exist on the
host before nginx starts (Docker would otherwise create it as root-owned).
